@startuml Citizen Access Sequence

actor "Citizen (IO App)" as cit
participant "CED Browser BE" as be
participant "Redis" as rd
box "FIMS / Identity Provider" #LightBlue
  participant "FIMS IdP" as idp
end box

cit -> be: GET /api/fauth?device=...
activate be
be --> cit: 302 Redirect to FIMS IdP authorization URL
deactivate be

cit -> idp: Follows redirect (authorization request)
idp -> cit: Authentication challenge (login/consent)
cit -> idp: Authenticates

idp -> be: GET /api/fcb?code=...&state=...&iss=...
activate be
be -> idp: Exchange code for identity token (OIDC token endpoint)
idp --> be: Identity token (fiscal code, profile)

be -> be: Validate token and extract identity
be -> rd: Store identity keyed by session token\n(sessionToken → identity)
rd --> be: OK
be -> rd: Bind short-lived id to session token\n(shortLivedId → sessionToken)
rd --> be: OK

be -> cit: 302 Redirect to /api/authorize?id=<shortLivedId>
deactivate be

cit -> be: GET /api/authorize?id=<shortLivedId>
activate be
be -> rd: Resolve shortLivedId → sessionToken
alt Short-lived id valid
    be -> rd: Delete binding (shortLivedId → sessionToken)
    rd --> be: OK
    be --> cit: 200 { token: "<session_token>" }
else Short-lived id invalid or expired
    be --> cit: 401 Unauthorized
end
deactivate be

@enduml
